# direnv integration for devenv — https://devenv.sh/automatic-shell-activation/
#
# This direnv build (2.37.1) does not ship the `use devenv` stdlib function
# (devenv support landed upstream in direnv 2.32 but is absent here), so source
# the rc that defines it from the devenv CLI. Requires `devenv` on PATH.
eval "$(devenv direnvrc)"
use devenv
